<!--
  Adaptive-icon foreground: a jaunty little sailboat, tilted into the wind,
  on a small wave. Kept inside the ~66dp safe zone of the 108dp canvas
  (roughly x/y 21-87) per the adaptive icon spec, since the system mask may
  crop anything outside it. The hull/mast/sail/pennant are grouped and
  rotated together (rakish "jaunty" lean); the wave stays level underneath
  since a tilted waterline reads as wrong rather than jaunty.
-->
